From: Marionette AirDrop driver research
Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL] observe monitor descriptors before and after MPDU restitch

WMI and userspace saw no AWDL in the mission tests. Observe the missing
host-DP boundary before inferring firmware rejection: use existing HAL frame
control validity/value accessors at the exact descriptor pointer already
used by both monitor 1.0 restitch paths, then count reconstructed frames
before packet-log/radiotap delivery. Root read-only atomic counters run only
while the gated STA-monitor experiment is loaded, including queued processing
that arrives after a bounded capture slot returns. Do not change buffer ownership, classification,
filtering, payload or packet fate. Post-frame reads are limited to the linear
head length. Missing HAL callbacks/invalid FC are reported rather than treated
as proof of absent frames. 0022 RAW resource experiment must be off for the
ordinary-Wi-Fi-preserving test.

